# Crashing-bug pipeline trace (2026-07-31) — ONE overfit leg, current standard
# config INCLUDING the semantic flags, deliberately: the point is to observe
# where a crashing bug branches in today's code and to verify the semantic-only
# gates no-op rather than to score anything.
#
# Leg: Lang-27 DeepRepair (overfit) — a crashing bug with long history in this
# project; was TP in the 2026-07-16 crashcheck run.
#
# What to read in trace.md afterwards:
#   1. "bug kind: crashing" and which stations then run/skip
#   2. zero synthesized relations / zero screening events (semantic gate holds)
#   3. acceptance requires a crash on the buggy build
#   4. whether the defect-family dismissal (run.py:2486) is reached
#   5. whether repair-in-place, diversion instrumentation, or the adjudicate
#      gates emit any events on this path
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 5 -m 12 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair"
CASES=(
  "-o Lang 27 DeepRepair"
)
